* the chart comparison of a datum sends the pure tensor `x ⊗ l` in degree `n` to
  `(w^n · l) · g^*(x / c^n)`, `w = ψ(c)`;
* it is the only isomorphism `ℳ̃_T ≅ h^*ℳ̃` with the second property along the opens of `T`.

